WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.640
Hello!

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.560
Right now, we are at

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.520
Suvarnabhumi Airport!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.080
And we're about to fly to?

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.000
Singapore!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.320
Yeah.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.240
We'll have a fan meeting in Singapore.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.760
There are so many fans in 
Singapore following and waiting for us.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.240
Where did you hear that from?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:21.840
I really want to know.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.920
I heard it, someone told me.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.880
(On social media.)

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.320
P'Mi has a lot of fans in Singapore.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.640
Nah, they’re Emi-Bonnie fans.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.600
(Have you ever been to Singapore before?)

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.120
Never.
Never?

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.000
I’ve never.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:35.920
Never been to Singapore?

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:36.480
Never.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.160
Really?

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.560
(This is Bonnie’s first time, then.)

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.040
It’s my very first time in Singapore.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.360
I’m so excited. I want to eat too.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.320
What do you want to eat?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.720
I want to eat Jumbo.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.680
The last time I went there was for a Taylor Swift concert.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.640
(Oh.)

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:50.400
That wasn’t long ago.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.080
Now we have to fly.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:53.800
Let’s fly.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.800
And we’ll see you in

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.200
Singapore!

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.160
(Where are we now?)

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.480
Now we’re at the hotel already.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.680
Finished signing posters.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.000
Yes.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.560
(Where did you go earlier?)

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.360
We went to eat at Jumbo.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.440
Jumbo.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.520
Jumbo is a seafood restaurant.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.680
We cracked crabs until our arms got as big as the crabs.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.520
Bonnie loves eating crab.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.560
I like it but no one cracks it for me.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.640
The staff cracked it for me.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.080
I can’t crack it myself.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.680
Because P'Mi doesn’t like cracking crabs.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.960
I don’t like eating seafood.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.880
Today we’ll go rest first.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.000
See you tomorrow.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.160
See you tomorrow.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.800
(Ah, do the Titanic pose, the ship is here!)

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.040
(And now we’re all dressed up already.)

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.600
(Yeah!)

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.080
(Why are you in red?)

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.360
Because we’re going to sing Kulabb
(means Rose in Thai).

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.560
(No, that’s not it. What song?)

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.360
Ku Lub Laew Der! 
(means “I’m sleeping now” in Thai.)

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.560
We almost fell asleep just now.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.560
Because if we’re not in red, 
we don’t have the energy to walk.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:39.800
(Yeah!)

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.640
(Here comes her hand.)

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.440
(After doing soundcheck earlier.)

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.800
(How was the audience’s energy?)

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.120
Wow, the energy was so good.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.360
Overflowing energy.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.040
Fans in Singapore are full of energy.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.880
(Even though the place wasn’t full yet.)

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.760
Really?

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.600
(Yes.)

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.040
(Just half.)

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:56.640
(Only half.)

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.600
Please keep cheering for us, everyone.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.360
We have to perform now.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.280
Right?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:01.780
Yes.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.200
(I love it.)

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.520
(Yes!)

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.520
Bye-bye!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.880
(Yummy?)

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.320
New Caption

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:20.560
Because some moments in the video, 
we might have already forgotten.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:25.000
I’m really grateful that you kept these cute moments.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.120
I was really looking forward 
to meeting everyone today.

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:31.680
Everyone welcomed us so warmly.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.080
Really, so warmly.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.920
The video you made was also so cute.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:44.440
That’s a wrap for the fan meeting in Singapore.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.520
Oh, the fans were so lovely.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.920
Yes, the energy was so good.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.320
The cheers were really amazing.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.600
Thank you so much.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:52.720
The singing was so loud.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:53.440
Yes.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.040
Yes.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.080
I’m so touched.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.880
Yes, very touched. We’ll definitely come back again.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:09:59.520
How do you know?

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.200
I just said it.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.520
We’ll definitely come back again!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:04.840
(Hey, how do you know?)

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:05.480
I don’t know.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:06.760
Manifest!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.240
Yes, let’s manifest it.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.040
With fans this lovely, we have to come back for sure.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:11.620
Yes.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.280
Thank you so much for coming to see us today.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.960
See you again.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.720
Bye-bye!

